[156.25, "o", "  \u001b[36m\u23bf Bash\u001b[0m \u001b[2mCommit run 14 docs\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[156.4, "o", "  \u001b[36m\u23bf TaskUpdate\u001b[0m \u001b[2m#7 \u2192 completed\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[156.55, "o", "\r\nHoltz run 14 complete. Converged.\r\n\r\n## Summary\r\n\r\n**8 findings, all resolved** across 3 commits:\r\n\r\n| ID | Severity | Category | Finding |\r\n|-----|----------|----------|---------|\r\n| BH-001 | MEDIUM | design/inconsistency | README metrics test only checked 1 of 9 fields \u2014 expanded to all 9 |\r\n| BH-002 | MEDIUM | design/inconsistency | No `\\s` convention check \u2014 added regression test |\r\n| BH-003 | MEDIUM | test/shallow | `parse_brief` had no edge case tests \u2014 added 2 |\r\n| BH-004 | MEDIUM | **bug/logic** | `\\s*` in field extraction leaked across fields on empty values \u2014 fixed to `[ \\t]*` |\r\n| BH-005 | MEDIUM | **bug/logic** | `parse_brief` matched code-fenced headers as real entries \u2014 added masking |\r\n| BH-006 | MEDIUM | doc/drift | README \"lines\" phrasing ambiguous \u2014 clarified to \"lines of code\" |\r\n| BH-007 | LOW | design/inconsistency | Hook path matching uses `in` \u2014 documented as design decision |\r\n| BH-008 | LOW | design/inconsistency | Stall detection said \"STALLED\" for regression \u2014 now says \"REGRESSING\" |\r\n\r\n**Adversarial self-play:** 2 agreements, 3 Holtz-only (the real bugs), 3 Justine-only (design concerns). Justine found the `\\s` convention violation but tested the wrong edge cases \u2014 she declared it \"functionally harmless.\" Holtz tested empty fields and code fences, found both bugs.\r\n\r\n**Prediction accuracy:** 2/5 confirmed (40%). Both confirmed predictions were in `pattern_brief_compact.py` \u2014 the pattern library caught them before a line of code was read.\r\n\r\n**Final state:** 324 tests, ruff clean, mypy clean, 67% coverage.\r\n"]
[158.05, "o", "\u001b[2m  [207,110 ctx | 478 out]\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[158.85, "o", "\r\nJustine's background task completed (she finished a while ago \u2014 her results were already merged during Pre-Phase 4). Run 14 is fully converged. All work is committed.\r\n"]
[160.35, "o", "\u001b[2m  [208,398 ctx | 43 out]\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[162.15, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[162.45, "o", "\u001b[1m  SUMMARY.md\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[162.55, "o", "\u001b[1m\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[162.95, "o", "# Holtz Summary\r\n"]
[163.01, "o", "\r\n"]
[163.07, "o", "**Project:** holtz\r\n"]
[163.13, "o", "**Run:** 14 (full audit with Justine)\r\n"]
[163.19, "o", "**Date:** 2026-03-24\r\n"]
[163.25, "o", "**Duration:** Phases 0-6 complete\r\n"]
[163.31, "o", "\r\n"]
[163.37, "o", "## Before / After\r\n"]
[163.43, "o", "\r\n"]
[163.49, "o", "| Metric | Baseline | Final |\r\n"]
[163.55, "o", "|--------|----------|-------|\r\n"]
[163.61, "o", "| Tests passing | 321 | 324 |\r\n"]
[163.67, "o", "| Tests failing | 0 | 0 |\r\n"]
